  },
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Promoter strength re-characterisation in the working backbone"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Re-measure the promoter ladder in OUR host and OUR backbone, because published strengths do not transfer."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Design"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each promoter drives "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " through the strong RBS "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", terminated by "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "label": "B0015",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", in "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Only the promoter varies."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Holding RBS, reporter, terminator and vector constant is what makes the resulting numbers a promoter ladder rather than five unrelated measurements."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Controls"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Positive: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-2c22f2e9",
              "label": "pJ02B2Rm control",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-2c22f2e9",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/pJ02B2Rm_AE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", a characterised composite from the same kit."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Negative: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with no transcription unit, to establish the autofluorescence floor. Without it, a weak promoter is indistinguishable from background."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Measurement"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Plate reader, 96-well, three biological and three technical replicates. Fluorescence normalised to OD600 and reported at mid-exponential phase."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Absolute units are not claimed. The ladder is internally calibrated and only ratios are carried forward."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-08928405",
              "label": "J23100",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-08928405",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23100_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-0bb366b5",
              "label": "J23102",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-0bb366b5",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23102_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " fall within 1.4-fold of each other in this backbone, closer than the published ladder suggests. "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-e1d41a3d",
              "label": "J23116",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-e1d41a3d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23116_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sits only 2.3-fold above the floor, which makes it unsuitable as a logic input."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Consequence for the programme"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-525cf33d",
              "label": "J23106",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is selected as the reference promoter for all downstream logic. "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-e1d41a3d",
              "label": "J23116",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-e1d41a3d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23116_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is retired from the input set \u2014 see entry 04 for the RBS-based tuning that replaces it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
